{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16566","headline":"夏日 · 刘复","name":"夏日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暎日纱窗深且闲，含桃红日石榴殷。\n银瓶绠转桐花井，沈水烟销金博山。\n文簟象牀娇倚瑟，彩匳铜镜嬾拈环。\n明朝戏去谁相伴，年少相逢狭路间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16566.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16566","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}